{"id": "ho_merge_time_ranges", "signature": "solve(ranges)", "statement": "`ranges` is a list of [start, end] pairs of integers with start <= end, describing closed intervals [start, end]. Two intervals are merged when they overlap or touch, i.e. when they share at least one point (so [1,2] and [2,3] merge, but [1,2] and [4,5] do not). Return the merged intervals as a list of [start, end] lists sorted by start. Return [] for an empty input. The input list may be in any order and is not modified.", "tests": [{"args": [[]], "expected": []}, {"args": [[[1, 3]]], "expected": [[1, 3]]}, {"args": [[[1, 2], [2, 3]]], "expected": [[1, 3]]}, {"args": [[[1, 4], [2, 3]]], "expected": [[1, 4]]}, {"args": [[[8, 10], [1, 3], [2, 6], [15, 18]]], "expected": [[1, 6], [8, 10], [15, 18]]}, {"args": [[[5, 5]]], "expected": [[5, 5]]}, {"args": [[[1, 2], [4, 5]]], "expected": [[1, 2], [4, 5]]}, {"args": [[[-3, -1], [-2, 0]]], "expected": [[-3, 0]]}, {"args": [[[0, 0], [0, 0]]], "expected": [[0, 0]]}, {"args": [[[10, 20], [1, 5], [3, 4]]], "expected": [[1, 5], [10, 20]]}, {"args": [[[1, 10], [2, 3], [4, 5], [6, 7]]], "expected": [[1, 10]]}], "facts": [["arg", "ranges", "interval_list"], ["iterate", "ranges"], ["ask", "merge_intervals"], ["interval_ends", "closed"], ["size", "ranges", "tiny"]], "deps": {"schema": ["interval_scan"], "uses": ["interval_merge"], "solution_sha256": "73ad080780056d2f83311f1d501fe90443536ee4a19c281ca8c5fd77c4e58658", "reference_sha256": "e0af6a9d72e2b161c98904846989bbd99f3a5eebd23683ed8afcb434ac9c5f2c"}}